con.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stand_Like_Stone\" title=\"Stand Like Stone\">Stand Like Stone</a>:</b> Spend 1 turn of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Force_Conduit_(Condition)\" title=\"Force Conduit (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Force_Conduit_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Force_Conduit_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Force_Conduit_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Force_Conduit_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Force_Conduit_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Force_Conduit_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Force Conduit\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Force_Conduit_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Force_Conduit_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Force_Conduit_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Force_Conduit_(Condition)\" title=\"Force Conduit (Condition)\">Force Conduit</a> to become a strong bulwark that cannot be moved unwillingly (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect